## Limits

The full Java suite does not execute browser JavaScript. Browser evidence verifies the observed month events and manager modal, but not all calendar roles/states or browser-managed file download. Payroll calculation and XLSX endpoints returned HTTP 200 and correct values; an interactive payroll page on the final DB was not re-opened after the browser tab automation timed out. MySQL 8.4 Testcontainers remains deferred per project policy.

